    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider (the current statement) is in force; or  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider (the current plan) is in force; or  (c) an approved ATS marketing plan for a primary universal service provider (the current plan) is in force; and the provider gives the ACA a draft variation of the current statement or current plan.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider (the current statement) is in force; or  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider (the current plan) is in force; or  (c) an approved ATS marketing plan for a primary universal service provider (the current plan) is in force; and the provider gives the ACA a draft variation of the current statement or current plan.";
