    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Must continue to be a digital data service provider.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The Minister revokes or varies a determination under section 15 so that a person ceases to be a digital data service provider for a digital data service area (the relevant area); or";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "A person must continue to be a digital data service provider for some or all of the area after certain events.";
