    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The thing is taken to have been done under or for the purposes of the latter provision if it was done before the commencement of Schedule 1.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) If:  (a) something was done (other than something covered by item 3), before this Act received the Royal Assent...";
